        -:    2:/* Link-only recorder for OWN-30B decode. No production launcher changes.
        -:    3: * Link with -Wl,--wrap=omega_gpu_session_launch, this object and src/cudapp_om_own30b_prof.c.
        -:    4: * Measures HOST times: elapsed_ns is submit-to-second-marker, NOT GPU cycles.
        -:    5: * Only complete sequences of 48 x (qkv, attention, o, router, gu, down) + head
        -:    6: * following a head are retained. Prefill, controls and partial steps are rejected.
        -:    7: * No allocation or I/O in the measured path. Dump raw integer totals at exit.
        -:    8: *
        -:    9: * The classifier, the sequence check, the token table and the dump text are the seeded Omega unit
        -:   10: * om/tools/own30b_prof.om (omega_own30b_prof). This file keeps the wrap: the clock, the real launch and the
        -:   11: * stderr writes. -DCUDAPP_MIGRATION_PENDING_C_TOOLS_OWN30B builds the former C body, kept as the oracle.
